# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Permanent Ascend grants a lasting blessing at ten permanents.
# Forcing: Two Saprolings raise seven permanents to nine, below the threshold.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield eliminate opposing decisions.
# Failure modes: 3/3 Saprolings expose an incorrectly granted blessing or bonus.
# Card roles: Dryad owns Ascend and the conditional bonus. Migration creates two tokens. Ornithopter and Forests set the count. Forests pay Migration.
# Protocol path: Ascend count badge, player designation gain and persistence, refreshed creature stats.
